<Base title="About CalcSolver | Online Calculator & Math Guides" description="Learn how CalcSolver brings together a free online scientific calculator, worked math guides and browser activities, with clear explanations of its limits." pageType="AboutPage" breadcrumbs={[{ name: 'Home', path: '/' }, { name: 'About', path: '/about/' }]}><div class="page-shell"><nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span> / </span><span>About</span></nav><h1>About CalcSolver: calculator & math guides</h1><p class="page-lead">A small tool for the numbers in your day.</p><div class="article-body"><h2>Our idea is simple</h2><p>Math tools should be easy to reach and easy to understand. CalcSolver.info brings together a browser calculator, short mathematical guides and activities for a little break between questions.</p><h2>Useful from the first click</h2><p>Use the calculator without signing up or installing an app. Calculations run on your device. Our guides show the method as well as the answer, so you can check your work and learn something along the way.</p><h2>How to use our math guides</h2><p>Each guide gives the rule and a worked example. Fraction conversions distinguish exact values from rounded repeating decimals; equivalent-fraction guides show how to check the result by cross-multiplication. The calculator evaluates numeric expressions. For symbolic equations, use the methods in our <a href="/category/algebra/">algebra guides</a>.</p><p>Calculator results use floating-point arithmetic and are displayed to 12 significant digits. Keep an exact fraction when rounding would lose information, and check the brackets and operators when a result surprises you.</p><h2>A little more to explore</h2><p>Code Mode opens a collection of activities. Enter 0000 to see the directory, or enter a four-digit activity number to open it directly. The local 2048 and Snake games run on this website; other activities load from external providers.</p><h2>About this domain</h2><p>This website is operated at calcsolver.info. It is a separate website from services using other CalcSolver domain names.</p></div><div class="calculator-cta"><span>Ready to work something out?</span><a href="/#calculator">Open the calculator →</a></div></div></Base>
